WEBVTT

00:01.638 --> 00:05.914
[Do not change the world to suit your desires;
first, change yourself.]

00:05.915 --> 00:11.922
[Do not change the world to suit your desires;
first, change yourself.]
[Descartes, Discourse on the Method]

00:15.517 --> 00:16.860
[Graduation Ceremony]

00:16.884 --> 00:18.393
[Graduation Ceremony]
Your graduating class representative,

00:18.868 --> 00:22.469
Class A's Horikita Manabu.

00:26.775 --> 00:31.899
Thank you. Today, the scent of plum blossoms
in the air brings tidings of spring.

00:32.540 --> 00:35.727
We have at last reached graduation.

00:36.396 --> 00:37.993
Though it's been three years,

00:38.001 --> 00:40.751
- I still vividly recall entering
- So, Nagumo's interference…

00:40.752 --> 00:43.313
- Advanced Nurturing High School with a goal…
- didn't ruin his standing in Class A.

00:44.492 --> 00:49.546
…to make this a high school career
I could take pride in.

00:50.181 --> 00:56.329
Through competition and driving one another to
improve, we triumphed over our special exams.

00:56.931 --> 01:02.431
And now, I could not be more grateful to be
graduating with every one of you today.

01:03.680 --> 01:09.875
And of course, the valiant efforts of our former
classmates were by no means in vain,

01:10.173 --> 01:17.485
and their courage is still
etched deeply within our hearts.

01:18.743 --> 01:22.711
Here and now, I can promise you
that this school's teachings

01:23.243 --> 01:27.273
will become invaluable treasures
in all of our lives.

01:28.189 --> 01:31.204
To those of you who feel lost now,

01:31.462 --> 01:34.243
I encourage you, too, to step forth without fear.

01:34.641 --> 01:36.985
The world you once found cold and distant

01:37.212 --> 01:41.321
will, I assure you, welcome you with open arms.

01:42.869 --> 01:45.751
Next year, and the next,

01:46.376 --> 01:52.446
the one who stands here to address you
will find the same light of understanding.

01:53.119 --> 01:56.491
For these past three years, I sincerely thank you.

01:57.907 --> 02:01.290
I have been your representative, Horikita Manabu.

03:32.970 --> 03:36.392
Before the closing ceremony tomorrow,

03:36.751 --> 03:39.986
I'd like to offer a quick review
of this past school year.

03:40.720 --> 03:46.829
Starting with the final special exam,
you put up an impressive fight against Class A.

03:47.580 --> 03:53.400
I can hardly believe you're the same students
who entered this school one short year ago.

03:53.572 --> 03:57.806
But, Miss, it's not that impressive when
we've dropped back down to Class D.

03:57.947 --> 04:01.259
We just ended up right back where we were.

04:01.603 --> 04:04.868
Just when we finally got to Class C…

04:04.930 --> 04:06.547
I know, right?

04:07.024 --> 04:13.586
You may be Class D again, but you've still
grown considerably over the past year.

04:14.251 --> 04:19.926
In terms of class points, you've
achieved more than any other class.

04:20.110 --> 04:23.587
All this praise is makin' me
wonder what the catch is.

04:23.588 --> 04:25.539
Is there something else comin'?

04:25.782 --> 04:27.184
Not at all.

04:27.579 --> 04:31.063
However, the other classes
have been improving as well.

04:33.344 --> 04:37.024
Whether or not you can
advance to a higher class again

04:37.274 --> 04:41.711
will depend on the work you continue
to put in every single day.

04:42.563 --> 04:46.703
We'll have a celebration today, but don't forget…

04:47.110 --> 04:51.242
Today is still a school day,
even though you don't have classes.

04:54.173 --> 04:56.789
It seems everyone struggled
with the last exam.

04:57.407 --> 05:01.117
I feel like Ryuuen really pulled one over on us.

05:02.079 --> 05:04.688
He soundly defeated Class B.

05:04.868 --> 05:08.750
I heard that a number of
students are still recovering.

05:11.243 --> 05:12.626
Ryuuen really laid his trap well.

05:12.627 --> 05:14.461
[Arithmetic, Kendo, Chemistry, English, Karate]
Ryuuen really laid his trap well.

05:14.461 --> 05:14.648
[Arithmetic, Kendo, Chemistry, English, Karate]

05:15.053 --> 05:16.913
But it's still mostly my fault

05:17.266 --> 05:19.711
for not being able to rally them.

05:19.938 --> 05:21.563
I was their leader…

05:21.618 --> 05:22.906
[Judo]

05:28.899 --> 05:29.913
[Yamada Albert]

05:35.560 --> 05:36.920
[Forfeit]

05:54.097 --> 05:57.776
You could appeal to the administration.
There's nothing to lose.

05:58.641 --> 06:01.719
I'd like to let this stand as a warning.

06:02.477 --> 06:03.711
What do you mean?

06:04.374 --> 06:08.584
If this happened at a critical
moment in our second or third year,

06:08.844 --> 06:11.562
who knows how hard up we would be…

06:12.149 --> 06:14.586
But right now, we're fine.

06:17.524 --> 06:18.437
True.

06:18.914 --> 06:24.141
So there's no need for me to weigh in
as an outsider from another class.

06:24.547 --> 06:27.484
I heard your class fought hard.

06:28.157 --> 06:32.789
You just keep getting stronger.
We'll have to watch our backs!

06:33.016 --> 06:34.726
And, on that note…

06:35.680 --> 06:40.883
I don't think we should continue
our alliance next year.

06:42.118 --> 06:46.031
I had a feeling you might say that.

06:46.727 --> 06:47.898
But…

06:48.445 --> 06:51.687
I think we can maintain a
favorable partnership, actually.

06:52.219 --> 06:55.766
If we end up needing to fill
a deficit in class points again,

06:55.782 --> 06:56.492
- maybe…
-No.

06:57.711 --> 07:03.492
I have my sights set on advancing
above Class B next year.

07:06.219 --> 07:12.226
I intend to accumulate enough points to be
in good condition to overtake Class A.

07:14.219 --> 07:15.953
I can tell you mean business.

07:16.407 --> 07:22.601
I appreciate you offering us your
cooperation when we were at a loss.

07:24.875 --> 07:28.211
Looks like we'll be starting our
second year as opponents.

07:29.047 --> 07:31.047
Class B will be giving it our all.

07:31.446 --> 07:32.195
Yes.

07:44.352 --> 07:46.352
Are you going to the celebration?

07:46.579 --> 07:51.680
If you're trying to ask if I'm going to see
my brother, I have no such intention.

07:52.040 --> 07:54.664
I thought you'd be able to talk to him now.

07:55.180 --> 07:57.180
That's none of your business.

08:00.407 --> 08:02.031
I'm gonna go see him.

08:03.837 --> 08:05.930
Is there a problem with that?

08:06.579 --> 08:07.867
Of course not.

08:08.079 --> 08:10.414
You're perfectly free to talk to him.

08:16.024 --> 08:17.430
But first…

08:18.031 --> 08:20.477
there's something I need to take care of.

08:23.305 --> 08:27.156
I'm currently suspended, pending
investigation of possible misconduct.

08:27.211 --> 08:30.891
I don't think I can do anything
to stop acting chairman Tsukishiro.

08:31.337 --> 08:39.070
If you cooperate with what he's planning,
it could throw the whole school into chaos.

08:40.039 --> 08:43.961
You're looking for an accomplice
who can oppose him, I assume.

08:44.813 --> 08:48.422
In that case, Mr. Mashima
would be a suitable choice.

08:49.790 --> 08:52.531
The school is full of security cameras.

08:52.954 --> 08:56.000
I'll arrange a meeting for you.

08:56.883 --> 08:59.852
Thank you. That's all, then.

08:59.946 --> 09:02.977
I'd like to ask you one more thing, if I may.

09:03.594 --> 09:04.367
Yes.

09:05.641 --> 09:10.175
You enrolled in the school
in pursuit of a normal life.

09:10.625 --> 09:14.235
Have you given any thought to
what you'll do when you graduate?

09:14.680 --> 09:16.992
My fate's already been decided for me.

09:17.868 --> 09:25.766
When I graduate I'll go back where I came from,
and start my path to leadership there.

09:26.352 --> 09:31.695
I suppose accepting your fate has
gotten you to where you are, too.

09:32.102 --> 09:37.202
That's why I intend to defend
the three years I have here.

09:38.758 --> 09:41.540
It's my hope that your time at this school will be

09:41.541 --> 09:46.555
a positive memory that you'll carry
with you for the rest of your life.

09:56.040 --> 09:57.524
Excuse me.

10:07.313 --> 10:12.555
A directive from Chairman Sakayanagi,
and a secret meeting right before the celebration…

10:13.196 --> 10:15.196
A bit drastic, isn't it?

10:15.751 --> 10:18.524
You've taken some drastic measures yourself.

10:18.820 --> 10:21.891
I thought you wanted to simply live in peace.

10:22.493 --> 10:27.047
I have important information
about acting chairman Tsukishiro.

10:27.173 --> 10:29.281
What? Out with it, then.

10:29.852 --> 10:35.133
What would you say if Chairman Sakayanagi's
suspension, and the final exam results

10:35.555 --> 10:40.578
were both set up by the acting chairman?

10:52.374 --> 10:55.210
I'm not fully convinced,

10:55.741 --> 10:59.522
but if what you're saying is true,
it's not something I can overlook.

11:00.077 --> 11:04.432
But I heard that your salary
was cut just this morning

11:04.433 --> 11:07.327
for violating the rules of the last special exam.

11:07.428 --> 11:09.374
A pay cut for breaking the rules?

11:09.491 --> 11:12.303
During the judo event between Class B and Class D.

11:12.726 --> 11:16.780
Class D selected Yamada Albert to compete.

11:17.218 --> 11:23.030
I see. If they had competed as planned,
it could have ended in severe injury.

11:23.382 --> 11:27.811
Accordingly, Mr. Mashima used his
best judgment and forfeited the event.

11:28.234 --> 11:31.444
I don't think the acting chairman
was pleased with that.

11:31.616 --> 11:35.475
So teachers aren't given any say.

11:36.046 --> 11:41.413
Any danger posed to students should be stopped.
Any impropriety should be corrected.

11:41.710 --> 11:45.585
How can we as teachers not follow
what we teach our students?

11:46.366 --> 11:48.428
Your mind is made up, then.

11:49.226 --> 11:54.499
If that's your decision, you have my support.

11:54.921 --> 11:57.874
Then our negotiations are settled.

11:58.366 --> 12:03.202
I'll be backing Ayanokouji
for the time being as well.

12:05.468 --> 12:10.225
Of course, this is only until
the acting chairman is removed.

12:10.921 --> 12:17.124
And if he poses a threat to Class A,
he will be crushed without hesitation.

12:17.507 --> 12:18.530
Very well.

12:18.796 --> 12:21.163
The celebration is about to begin.

12:21.515 --> 12:27.577
The students should leave first.
Then we can stagger our exits.

12:31.734 --> 12:36.047
It's a tricky position we've been thrown into.

12:36.671 --> 12:41.499
Can we really settle all of this just by
ousting acting chairman Tsukishiro?

12:42.054 --> 12:43.444
What are you suggesting?

12:44.015 --> 12:48.280
We can't be sure they won't just
send in another assassin in his place.

12:48.671 --> 12:54.350
If that happens, it won't be just Ayanokouji's
problem anymore, but his entire year…

12:55.062 --> 12:59.483
No, depending on the circumstances,
it could even hurt the school as a whole.

13:00.046 --> 13:02.342
We may be in hot water.

13:02.710 --> 13:07.233
With any luck, my suspicions
will amount to nothing.

13:08.062 --> 13:09.538
We can only hope.

13:09.956 --> 13:14.961
[Classroom of the Elite
3rd Season]

13:25.214 --> 13:26.737
So you showed up after all.

13:27.925 --> 13:29.726
What, is that a problem?

13:30.050 --> 13:35.120
I was just thinking that the person
you used to be wouldn't have come.

13:35.479 --> 13:36.885
Think what you will.

13:37.144 --> 13:40.495
I am who I am. Nothing has changed.

13:43.690 --> 13:49.573
Class A or not, everyone's just
happy they made it to graduation.

13:49.995 --> 13:52.995
In lieu of an express ticket
to achieving your dreams,

13:53.034 --> 13:55.877
I suppose you can still blaze your own trail.

14:00.800 --> 14:02.338
You can go ahead.

14:03.190 --> 14:05.737
It's your privilege as his sister.

14:05.800 --> 14:07.534
W-Wait!

14:11.012 --> 14:15.589
It wouldn't feel right to just
run to him as I am now.

14:15.738 --> 14:16.522
Rather,

14:16.785 --> 14:18.222
I'm undeserving.

14:19.832 --> 14:21.941
It's not that I'm getting cold feet.

14:22.395 --> 14:27.511
I came here to see how he
spent his three years here.

14:30.137 --> 14:33.816
I'm leaving. I've done what I came here to do.

14:34.285 --> 14:35.449
What about you?

14:35.965 --> 14:38.394
I'm gonna stay a little longer.

14:38.793 --> 14:40.793
Fine. See you.

14:54.461 --> 14:56.226
Are you waiting for me?

14:57.274 --> 15:02.375
I figured this might be the last time
I get to talk to you.

15:03.719 --> 15:05.719
It looks like Suzune's left already.

15:06.414 --> 15:11.039
For now, she's just committing the fruits
of your three years here to memory.

15:12.211 --> 15:13.695
Sorry.

15:14.094 --> 15:19.109
Maybe I should have tried to do more
about the student council.

15:19.789 --> 15:21.570
I have a favor to ask.

15:22.453 --> 15:25.101
I'll be leaving this school on the 31st.

15:25.453 --> 15:29.437
Tell Suzune I'll be waiting at
the front gates at noon that day.

15:29.961 --> 15:32.757
Can't you tell her yourself?

15:33.062 --> 15:35.320
I want you to try to get through to her.

15:35.781 --> 15:39.078
She might not feel as open with me.

16:11.992 --> 16:16.070
This is my brother's last day here.

16:17.422 --> 16:22.218
This whole year, I've failed
to show him any improvement.

16:24.695 --> 16:26.922
Can I let him leave like this?

16:28.742 --> 16:34.679
I've just been chasing after him. As I am now,
I'm an embarrassment as a sister.

16:36.399 --> 16:37.554
A sham.

16:38.274 --> 16:40.070
I'm nothing but a fraud.

16:41.164 --> 16:45.562
If I'm honest, I only wanted to show him…

16:56.283 --> 16:57.392
Thank you.

16:57.760 --> 17:04.876
My fake and unmistakably real self.

17:36.676 --> 17:38.909
Sorry, she's not here yet.

17:39.597 --> 17:40.597
I see.

17:43.371 --> 17:44.644
Ayanokouji.

17:44.871 --> 17:49.277
Why are you always hiding your true abilities?

17:49.629 --> 17:53.370
I just don't like standing out, I guess.

17:54.152 --> 18:00.120
Is there any real value in spending
your school days hiding behind the scenes?

18:02.402 --> 18:06.636
Didn't you come to this school
to leave some lasting impact?

18:07.097 --> 18:08.894
A lasting impact…

18:09.449 --> 18:13.675
I'll leave that to the really
outstanding people like you.

18:13.902 --> 18:17.456
Then, if not the school, you can at least…

18:18.010 --> 18:20.456
…leave your fellow students with something.

18:22.347 --> 18:27.081
They'll have a memory of their classmate
Ayanokouji Kiyotaka etched into their minds,

18:27.637 --> 18:29.902
never to be forgotten.

18:30.910 --> 18:34.214
Thank you for all you've done for my sister.

18:34.855 --> 18:39.292
I know you're not the type of man to stop there.

18:39.871 --> 18:41.472
So, please,

18:42.293 --> 18:44.355
don't disappoint me.

18:46.676 --> 18:48.519
I'll keep that in mind.

18:48.965 --> 18:52.909
That's all I ask. You'll find your own answers.

18:54.426 --> 18:56.339
I should be going.

18:56.754 --> 18:59.956
Sorry for troubling you even
on my very last day here.

19:00.465 --> 19:04.159
Shouldn't you at least try
calling her before you go?

19:04.504 --> 19:10.128
No, my fleeting feelings aren't worth
potentially hindering her growth further.

19:10.637 --> 19:12.637
This is my own selfishness speaking,

19:13.019 --> 19:15.425
but I leave Suzune in your care.

19:22.199 --> 19:24.699
Let's meet again one day, Ayanokouji.

19:36.382 --> 19:37.663
Manabu!

19:45.503 --> 19:48.417
Sorry it took me so long.

19:50.745 --> 19:52.409
So you have changed.

19:58.902 --> 20:03.339
Or, rather… you're back to your old self, Suzune.

20:03.604 --> 20:08.620
Sorry it took all year… no,
it's been several years already.

20:14.201 --> 20:20.497
I've decided that I want to keep moving forward
for my classmates from now on.

20:22.334 --> 20:28.482
I'm going to study my hardest with them,
so I can find my own path someday.

20:28.926 --> 20:33.269
You really have found yourself
again, after all this time.

20:36.520 --> 20:40.801
Do you understand the most important
reason I pushed you away?

20:40.957 --> 20:41.863
No.

20:42.324 --> 20:48.222
You were trapped in my shadow.
I couldn't let you stay there.

20:50.026 --> 20:50.791
But,

20:51.065 --> 20:52.995
you'll be alright now.

20:53.064 --> 20:55.236
I can finally say that with confidence.

20:57.120 --> 21:01.002
Meet them with strength, and with kindness.

21:01.128 --> 21:01.994
I will.

21:02.510 --> 21:05.619
And, I owe you an apology.

21:07.510 --> 21:08.627
That day,

21:09.003 --> 21:11.580
I was lying when I said I preferred long hair.

21:11.784 --> 21:12.510
Huh?

21:12.901 --> 21:16.534
I knew you preferred short styles,
and I wanted to see…

21:16.830 --> 21:18.627
if you'd take my words to heart.

21:18.682 --> 21:20.017
So I lied.

21:21.831 --> 21:22.666
Forgive me.

21:28.737 --> 21:30.190
I forgive you.

21:30.705 --> 21:35.587
Because I know that lie led us to this moment.

21:36.190 --> 21:40.658
Suzune. You are so precious to me.

21:42.307 --> 21:43.393
Manabu…

21:44.495 --> 21:48.510
I'll be waiting on the other side of
these gates in two years' time.

21:49.870 --> 21:51.979
I'll want to see how far you've come.

21:52.408 --> 21:53.377
Okay.

21:53.549 --> 21:58.439
I'll fight with everything I've got,
right to the very end.

21:59.034 --> 22:00.088
I'll see you then.

22:00.714 --> 22:01.541
Right.
